FOUR PLAYER BATTLE

Guide more chus into your rocket than your opponents to win.

Each player has an rocket - this is the same colour as your pointer. 

For each chu that you guide into your rocket you receive one point. 
Gold chus are worth 50 points so look out for them!
Purple Chus trigger the spinner which will trigger a  random event.

Kapus will eat a third of chus in your rocket so avoid letting them enter! 
Guide Kapus into your opponents rocket for maximum devastation.

The player with the highest score when the time runs out is the winner
